1325 GOSUB 6120:BM$="Susanna grabbed David's hand, and they ran into the corridor leading\down to the basement, holding a candle.":GOSUB 5100
1330 GOSUB 6130:BM$="At the end of the corridor, they turned left.":GOSUB 5100
1335 GOSUB 6140:BM$="After a while, they reached a door.":GOSUB 5100
1340 GOSUB 9575:GOSUB 6150:BM$="Susanna opened the door. Beyond it was a staircase going down.":GOSUB 5100
1350 GOSUB 6180:BM$="At the bottom of the staircase was a wine cellar.":GOSUB 5100
1351 GOSUB 6160:BM$="Further on, there was another door.":GOSUB 5100
1352 COMMON FO:GOSUB 9575:GOSUB 6170:BM$="Susanna opened it. It was too dark to see anything.":GOSUB 5100
